msgstr "向后分支（for 循环）由于对 %1 的变量引用而依赖 ID，可能导致性能下降"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/altera/IdDependentBackwardBranchCheck.cpp:260
msgctxt "altera-id-dependent-backward-branch"
msgid "backward branch (while loop) is ID-dependent due to ID function call and may cause performance degradation"
msgstr "向后分支（while 循环）由于调用 ID 函数而依赖 ID，可能导致性能下降"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/altera/IdDependentBackwardBranchCheck.cpp:276
msgctxt "altera-id-dependent-backward-branch"
msgid "backward branch (while loop) is ID-dependent due to member reference to %1 and may cause performance degradation"
msgstr "向后分支（while 循环）由于对 %1 的成员引用而依赖 ID，可能导致性能下降"

