msgid "either cast from %0 to %1 is ineffective, or there is loss of precision before the conversion"
msgstr "从 %0 到 %1 的类型转换无效，或者在转换前存在精度损失"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/MissingEndComparisonCheck.cpp:207
