msgstr "标准算法的结果被用作 'bool'；您是否打算与尾后迭代器（end iterator）进行比较？"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/MoveForwardingReferenceCheck.cpp:130
msgctxt "bugprone-move-forwarding-reference"
msgid "forwarding reference passed to std::move(), which may unexpectedly cause lvalues to be moved; use std::forward() instead"
msgstr "将转发引用传递给 std::move() 可能会意外导致左值被移动；请改用 std::forward()"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/MultiLevelImplicitPointerConversionCheck.cpp:94
msgctxt "bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion"
msgid "multilevel pointer conversion from %0 to %1, please use explicit cast"
msgstr "从 %0 到 %1 的多级指针转换，请使用显式类型转换"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/MultipleNewInOneExpressionCheck.cpp:145
msgctxt "bugprone-multiple-new-in-one-expression"
msgid "memory allocation may leak if an other allocation is sequenced after it and throws an exception"
msgstr "如果另一个内存分配排序在其后并抛出异常，则该内存分配可能会泄漏"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/MultipleNewInOneExpressionCheck.cpp:150
msgctxt "bugprone-multiple-new-in-one-expression"
msgid "memory allocation may leak if an other allocation is sequenced after it and throws an exception; order of these allocations is undefined"
msgstr "如果另一个内存分配排序在其后并抛出异常，则该内存分配可能会泄漏；这些分配的顺序是未定义的"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/MultipleStatementMacroCheck.cpp:98
