msgstr "从 %0 到 %1 的窄化转换"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/NarrowingConversionsCheck.cpp:341
msgctxt "bugprone-narrowing-conversions"
msgid "narrowing conversion from %0 to signed type %1 is implementation-defined"
msgstr "从 %0 到有符号类型 %1 的窄化转换是由实现定义的"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/NarrowingConversionsCheck.cpp:367
