msgid "ignoring the result of 'empty()'; did you mean 'clear()'? "
msgstr "忽略了 'empty()' 的返回值；您是指 'clear()' 吗？"

#: clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/bugprone/StdExceptionBaseclassCheck.cpp:41
