#: clang/lib/StaticAnalyzer/Checkers/CStringSyntaxChecker.cpp:254
msgctxt "clang-analyzer-unix.cstring.BadSizeArg"
msgid "The third argument allows to potentially copy more bytes than it should. Replace with the value sizeof(%0) or lower"
msgstr "第三个实参可能会复制超过应有数量的字节。请替换为 sizeof(%0) 或更小的值"

